  "description": "Official .NET SDK for the QQZeng QZDB IP geolocation database. Offline, dependency-free, high-performance IPv4/IPv6 lookup with a lock-free, hot-reloadable reader/registry API. 纯离线 IP 地理定位数据库官方 .NET SDK，零依赖、支持热更新。",
